# Manifold level 10
# The tower's entrance (stage 5d; lengthened in 5p, decision 0031: floors as rhythm, each one idea taught,
# developed, twisted and concluded): the jump, on the ground, where a fall costs only the way back. A hop
# onto a platform; a wall 3 m high whose ledge is grabbed (the gym: up to 3.25 m); a chimney 2.4 m wide up
# to the terrace 6 m up (a rest, its checkpoint). Then, over the ground: a pillar 2 m off, one a meter
# lower 2 m on, one 4.5 m on (walking, a jump goes 3.75: running, 6.25); a block 3 m higher 1.5 m on (its
# ledge, grabbed); on it, a chimney 2.4 m wide up to the last terrace, 15 m up, the goal, its beacon lit
# from the start. Stars: on a pillar 3 m high (its ledge), on an island a running jump away, and at the top
# of a chimney 3.2 m wide and 9 m high.
title The entrance
spawn 0 1 7
facing 0 0 -1
sky 18.6

